cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Does the Payout–Leverage Relationship Vary with the Interest Rate Regime? Analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  The empirical pipeline of a master's thesis in Quantitative Finance (Faculty of Economic Sciences,
  University of Warsaw). It builds a panel of 140 US non-financial industries over 1999-2025 from
  Aswath Damodaran's industry datasets and FRED, checks and corrects the data, and estimates two-way
  fixed-effects models of payout on leverage and its interaction with the interest-rate regime, with
  bounds for the null results, robustness and multiple-testing checks. It is tested on synthetic data
  with planted effects and planted data defects.
authors:
